message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "weno_singular"
abstract: >-
  WENO solvers for hyperbolic conservation laws with singular source terms.
  Modular Python implementations of WENO3 and WENO5 schemes on uniform meshes,
  with explicit and semi-implicit time integration.
authors:
  - family-names: "Türk"
    given-names: "İrfan"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-04-28"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/irfanturk/weno_singular"
keywords:
  - WENO
  - hyperbolic conservation laws
  - singular source terms
  - finite volume
  - Python
references:
